OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-run school meals service
OL,4,Ato end in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it can no longer
OL,7,Fafford to subsidise school meals and
OL,8,Fplans to cut funding for its school
OL,9,Fmeals service, in a move aimed at
OL,10,Fsaving #500,000.
OL,12,FWarrington Borough Council said it
OL,13,Fwould stop providing the school meal
OL,14,Fprovision from September 2027, with
OL,15,Fschools expected to make alternative
OL,16,Fcatering arrangements.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
