OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-run school meals service
OL,4,Ato end in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to seven management and support
OL,7,Fstaff could face redundancy, although
OL,8,Fthe council said there was no immediate
OL,9,Fthreat to their jobs and no current
OL,10,Fimplications for the remaining 242
OL,11,Fschool meals workers - with school
OL,12,Fmeals still being provided.
OL,14,FThe move forms part of #51.2m of
OL,15,Fsavings approved last month as the
OL,16,Fcouncil seeks to tackle its financial
OL,17,Fproblems.
